      "writtenOn": "2015-04-16T16:29:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "2 is not necessarily the motion_sensor_count. It\u0027s the count of *lsm6ds0* sensors. For example, samus has the accel and gyro from the lsm6ds0, but also has the accelerometer from the kxcj9 (producing a motion_sensor_count of 3).\n\n\nIf I come up with a way to obtain the lsm6ds0 sensor count, I could move this.",
